\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sl276\slmult1\cf1\lang1033\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Me wura Yesu, s[ wony[ me gyefo; 
\par na wo mogya no mpopa me b]ne a,
\par anka [he na me a mey[ mm]b] 
\par menya mafa po? 
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Anka minni tenabew w] m'ahohiam; 
\par obiara komam nni d] s[ wo de 
\par na wo nkutoo ne me kra guank]bea,
\par ebi nni baabi.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Wo d] ne w'ayamye ne wo wahumm]b]
\par Ne wo boaset] ne wo nokware 
\par ma m'anim gu ase, nanso minim daa s[ 
\par menya nkwa w] mu.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. S[ Yesu anni kan anhwehw[ me a,
\par anka me nko mamma Onyame nky[n da;
\par enti ]de ayamhyehye hwehw[[ me, 
\par nanso wahu me.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. N' afei miyi me yam meda no ase 
\par s[ wayi ]desani te s[ me bi,
\par na ]de me afra n'asafo mma mu 
\par w] n'ahenni mu. \f1 
\par \pard\lang2057\f2 
\par }

